1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 21=

34
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,640
Where is he?

35
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,560
Why did we come here?

36
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,200
After the Empress left,

37
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,920
this place was returned to Mr. Huang Jr.

38
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:16,960
Now he can only go find
the Lord of Youming City.

39
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,160
You...

40
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,920
Where did this crazy monk come from?

41
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:22,920
Monk,

42
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:25,400
you wouldn't happen to be
my mother's master, would you?

43
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,680
What do you mean, your mother?

44
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,800
Zixuan, Zimo.

45
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:30,880
Don't be rude.

46
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,920
Wait...

47
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,480
They are...

48
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:34,280
They are...

49
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:35,920
Our children.

50
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,320
Children?

51
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,480
Yours?

52
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,680
Of course.

53
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:46,360
This is the power of our Youming City.

54
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,600
Whenever needed,

55
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:48,980
Youming City can raise

56
00:02:48,981 --> 00:02:50,360
an army of a million
within half a month.

57
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,280
Oh, give me a break.

58
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,320
I was just coming to find you.

59
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,960
Someone is causing trouble
at Youming City

60
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,720
and wants to drain your spiritual power.

61
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,440
I already know.

62
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,840
Let's see where you can run now!

63
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,280
Three-Headed Jiao.

64
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:08,440
You are no match for the Lord
of Youming City.

65
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,200
Wait!

66
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:14,280
A lowly demon like you

67
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,440
actually wants to steal
my spiritual power?

68
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,200
Are you kidding me?

69
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,160
Normally,

70
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:22,200
I would've already beaten you
until your soul was destroyed

71
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,880
and taken you back as my slave.

72
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,000
Once he shows his true power,

73
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,680
he'll easily capture

74
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,200
the Three-Headed Jiao.

75
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,040
We won't even need to lift a finger.

76
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,000
But you know,

77
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,400
now,

78
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,840
I want to change

79
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,040
my rough and violent image a little.

80
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:39,640
No more fighting.

81
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,440
So,

82
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:42,200
I don't want to fight anymore.

83
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,240
You want my spiritual power, right?

84
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,560
Take it!

85
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:02,120
I got it.

86
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,400
When you gave him your spiritual power,

87
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,600
did you hide something inside it,

88
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,902
like

89
00:04:06,903 --> 00:04:08,640
virus or something?

90
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,640
No. I gave him
my spiritual power honestly.

91
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,000
Stop messing around.

92
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,450
You didn't put anything in it?

93
00:04:12,450 --> 00:04:14,440
Then why would you give him
your spiritual power?

94
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,440
Because I have you.

95
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:16,360
What do I have to worry about?

96
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:17,960
Once you defeat him,

97
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,040
you can take the spiritual power back

98
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,360
and return it to me. Simple, right?

99
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:23,200
I don't have any spiritual power left.

100
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:23,840
Gosh.

101
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,360
You've got to be kidding me.

102
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,840
I'm serious.

103
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,960
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

104
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,440
You never asked.

105
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,720
What, was I supposed to tell everyone,

106
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,440
"I'm a powerless loser"?

107
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,200
Like that?

108
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,900
- That was reckless.
- Very reckless.

109
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:36,920
- Reckless.
- Very reckless.

110
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:42,400
- Reckless.
- Very reckless.

111
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,560
My face is healed.

112
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,280
I can finally save my wife.

113
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,040
You demon!

114
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,440
Why did you frame me?

115
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,800
Darling!

116
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:11,720
Help!

117
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,480
Darling!

118
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,480
Let her go!

119
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:21,920
Darling!

120
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,840
Darling!

121
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,000
Are you alright?

122
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:26,000
My head hurts so much.

123
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:28,200
My illness is acting up.

124
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:29,640
I'm afraid

125
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,640
I don't have much time left.

126
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,840
It's all because I failed
to become a true dragon.

127
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:37,640
My Lord, you lack true dragon's blood.

128
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,080
The only way now

129
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,960
is to consume this monk

130
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,800
to save your wife.

131
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,480
Darling.

132
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,600
No, no.

133
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,400
Don't eat me!

134
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,040
My head hurts.

135
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,920
This monk has cultivated
through ten lifetimes,

136
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,000
accumulating boundless merit.

137
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,080
Consume him,

138
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:55,760
and your demonic energy can
be transformed into true Qi,

139
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:56,760
allowing you to become a true dragon

140
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:58,040
and save your wife.

141
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,200
Monk.

142
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,560
To save my wife,

143
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,320
I have no choice but to consume you.

144
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,000
Don't!

145
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,920
Benefactor!

146
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,160
You're a good person.

147
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,320
That snake demon isn't sick at all.

148
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,320
My head hurts.

149
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,300
This monk

150
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:15,720
is an Arhat reincarnated.

151
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:16,600
If you eat him,

152
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,920
you'll bring disaster upon yourself.

153
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,500
Exactly.

154
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:20,260
I have many brothers.

155
00:06:20,260 --> 00:06:22,320
Watch out, or they'll come after you
for revenge.

156
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,480
You traitor!

157
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,480
My head... it hurts.

158
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,800
What are you waiting for? Do it!

159
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,280
Monk,

160
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,360
to save my wife,

161
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,480
I have no choice but to eat you!

162
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,320
Stop!

163
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,400
Piaopiao?

164
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:49,560
Demon.

165
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,040
I was sent here by Her Majesty

166
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:55,240
to return Dragon-Subduing Arhat's
spiritual power.

167
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:00,320
Hmph.

168
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,880
Trying to fool me with the same trick
again?

169
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,760
Guess whether I'll fall for it.

170
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,460
Piaopiao.

171
00:07:05,550 --> 00:07:06,180
You're back.

172
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:07,080
I'm touched.

173
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,080
But I've already used

174
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:10,040
this trick before.

175
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,680
Master.

176
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,960
Do you really think I'd leave you

177
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:15,720
just to become a celestial maiden?

178
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:19,240
Back then, when I saw Her Majesty
refuse to return your spiritual power,

179
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,720
I went with her to Heaven.

180
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,680
You don't know this,

181
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,840
but I tried every way I could to please
the Jade Empress and the Jade Emperor,

182
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,640
so they agreed to restore your powers.

183
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,560
Really?

184
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,320
(Dragon-Subduing Arhat.)

185
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:32,520
(Your conduct has been improper,)

186
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:34,080
(but I am both beautiful and generous,)

187
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,320
(so I hereby return your
spiritual power to you today.)

188
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,560
That's wonderful!

189
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,760
Thank you, Your Majesty!

190
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,240
I love you!

191
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:50,760
Now it's my turn.

192
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:51,920
Arhat

193
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,880
Heaven-Turning

194
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,160
Seal!

195
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:57,120
Since everyone wants to see me
use this move,

196
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,920
I'll just do you all a favor

197
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:00,320
and show it off a little.

198
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,760
Even if he gets his spiritual power
back,

199
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,200
he still won't be a match for you.

200
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:04,960
Do it now!

201
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,440
Arhat

202
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:08,880
Heaven-Turning

203
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:09,320
Seal!

204
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:29,920
Old fox,

205
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,320
you're next.

206
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,240
How did you let them escape?

207
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,040
My spiritual power!

208
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:47,040
If we leave this fox demon unchecked,

209
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,280
it will endanger all Three Realms.

210
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:49,360
Demon!

211
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,080
Get up.

212
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,000
Take us to her.

213
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,880
I won't betray my benefactor.

214
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,480
They beat you to a pulp,

215
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,880
and you're still defending them?

216
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:02,480
Fine.

217
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,880
Since you refuse to cooperate,

218
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:04,840
don't blame me

219
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,640
for being rough with you.

220
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,240
My life was saved by my benefactor.

221
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:08,920
Killing me

222
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:09,960
won't help you.

223
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:11,280
Fine.

224
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,880
Tell me when you're ready.

225
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,240
Seal!

226
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:34,360
This gourd contains heavenly thunder
and earthly fire.

227
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:35,920
With your level of spiritual power,

228
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,280
you won't last three hours.

229
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:39,080
Come to your senses whenever you like.

230
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:40,480
Then call for me.

231
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,800
Welcome, Ancestor.

232
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,040
It's all because of that filthy monk.

233
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,520
Darling.

234
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,960
Didn't you say I was incredibly
powerful?

235
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,560
How come I can't even defeat a monk?

236
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:10,800
So you were missing a scale, My Lord.

237
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,880
No wonder you lost to that monk.

238
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,080
This scale...

239
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,600
I gave it to Su Ling'er to heal
her wounds.

240
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,040
I used my spiritual power

241
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:29,760
to stabilize your wife's condition.

242
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,560
My Lord, recover from your injuries
here first.

243
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,240
Once I retrieve the scale,

244
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:37,400
you can defeat that monk

245
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:40,040
and save your wife.

246
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:50,320
Let's toast to our parents.

247
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:51,760
My Lord,

248
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:54,200
we'd like to toast you.

249
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,960
Let me toast my brother.

250
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:56,880
Oh...

251
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,320
We owe it all to Piaopiao today.

252
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,160
As your master,

253
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,280
I'm truly touched.

254
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:01,600
Here,

255
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,160
let me toast

256
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,960
to celestial maiden Yanzhi.

257
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:09,600
You came down to the mortal world

258
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,840
just to keep me company. I feel bad.

259
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,440
Then I'll toast to everyone as well.

260
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,280
Thank you all

261
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:17,440
for always being there for me.

262
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,480
Cheers!

263
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,600
Are you okay?

264
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,320
What's wrong?

265
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,640
I'm fine.

266
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,960
I just feel a little dizzy.

267
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,200
Your tolerance for alcohol

268
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,560
is really low.

269
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:59,840
I think it's not the wine that got
you drunk, but your own feelings.

270
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,920
Just drink your wine.

271
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,080
Arhat,

272
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,760
could you please

273
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,800
take me back to my room to rest?

274
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:11,400
Of course.

275
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:13,280
I'll help you.

276
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,480
Here, eat up.

277
00:12:25,349 --> 00:12:25,936
Here.

278
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,000
Get some good rest.

279
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,920
Xiuyuan.

280
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:38,000
Why did you call me by my worldly name?

281
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:40,720
Actually,

282
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,517
I already know

283
00:12:42,518 --> 00:12:44,600
about our past together.

284
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:48,400
Xiuyuan.

285
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:50,400
Close your eyes.

286
00:12:50,640 --> 00:12:52,360
I have something to tell you.

287
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,080
You wretched monk.

288
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:05,080
Seems you still haven't severed
your worldly attachments.

289
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,680
It's you!

290
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:15,670
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

291
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:18,930
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

292
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:22,730
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

293
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:25,760
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

294
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:32,970
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

295
00:13:32,990 --> 00:13:36,520
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

296
00:13:43,230 --> 00:13:46,430
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

297
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:49,690
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

298
00:13:49,980 --> 00:13:53,000
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

299
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:54,690
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

300
00:13:54,730 --> 00:13:56,610
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

301
00:13:56,650 --> 00:13:58,170
♪I left my wife behind♪

302
00:13:58,310 --> 00:13:59,770
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

303
00:13:59,810 --> 00:14:03,590
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

304
00:14:03,650 --> 00:14:04,730
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

305
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:06,830
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

306
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:08,530
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

307
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:10,400
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

308
00:14:10,430 --> 00:14:13,760
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

309
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:17,030
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

310
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:20,160
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

311
00:14:20,180 --> 00:14:23,530
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

312
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:27,190
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

313
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:30,540
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

314
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:33,650
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

315
00:14:34,230 --> 00:14:37,280
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

316
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:40,720
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

317
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:44,280
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

318
00:14:44,300 --> 00:14:47,760
♪You're just wasting your time♪

319
00:14:47,810 --> 00:14:50,730
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

320
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,390
♪And I just laugh happily♪

321
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:55,800
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

322
